This project includes a modified/adapted copy of Classy's Kotlin timetable
parser layer: 41 Kotlin files / 42 parser classes under
  android/app/src/main/java/com/imsx3d/classy/data/jw/
plus the bridge
  android/app/src/main/kotlin/com/hsu/hsu_schedule/ClassyParserBridge.kt
The per-class coverage list is docs/CLASSY_PARSERS.md.

It is compiled into the Android app and called through
ClassyParserBridge / the com.hsu.hsu_schedule/classy_parser MethodChannel.
The school preset data was transformed into schools/index.json (348 of the 350
entries come from Classy; 黄山学院 uses this app's native flow and one entry is a
community submission). The zf_new fallback was ported to Dart in
lib/classy_parser.dart; the Flutter-side bridge is lib/classy_bridge_service.dart.
Each copied Kotlin/Dart file carries an attribution header naming commit 8a2499d.

Modifications: package/application integration, a Flutter MethodChannel
bridge, conversion from Classy JwCourse records to this app's timetable HTML,
removal of unused Compose/ViewModel/database code, and consolidation of the
duplicated even/odd-week endpoint fix into JwParity.kt. No Compose UI code
was copied.

